---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Matilda Gitonga — Resume" description="Resume of Matilda Mwendwa Gitonga, a software engineer working across software engineering, applied AI, data, and cybersecurity.">
	<main class="resume-page-main mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 sm:py-16">
		<header class="border-b border-border pb-10">
			<div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-center">
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Resume</p>
					<h1 class="resume-name mt-4 font-heading text-[clamp(1.55rem,6vw,3rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">Matilda Mwendwa Gitonga</h1>
					<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted">Software Engineer</p>
				</div>
				<a
					class="resume-desktop-pdf interactive-control interactive-control--accent hidden w-fit whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium sm:inline-flex"
					href="/resume.pdf"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>View resume PDF ↗</a>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-7">
				<ContactLinks
					includeLocation
					compact
					primaryAction={{ label: 'View resume PDF ↗', href: '/resume.pdf' }}
				/>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="resume-layout mt-10 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_16rem] lg:gap-16">
			<div class="space-y-12">
				<section aria-labelledby="summary-title" class="resume-profile-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7">
					<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Profile</p>
					<h2 id="summary-title" class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl">Engineering with context.</h2>
					<p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-muted">Computer Science graduate with experience across software engineering, data analysis, databases, cybersecurity, and applied AI. Experienced in Python, SQL, JavaScript/TypeScript, relational and NoSQL databases, and data-driven research, with practical experience developing software systems, analysing large datasets, and building AI-enabled solutions.</p>
				</section>

				<section aria-labelledby="experience-title">
					<div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
						<div>
							<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Experience</p>
							<h2 id="experience-title" class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl">Employment history</h2>
						</div>
						<span class="hidden font-mono text-xs text-muted sm:block">01—03</span>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-6 space-y-8 border-l border-border pl-6">
						<article>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
								<h3 class="text-lg font-medium">Software Engineering Intern · Microsoft</h3>
								<p class="text-sm text-muted">Jan 2024 – Apr 2024</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Nairobi, Kenya</p>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Optimized database queries, indexing, and caching strategies in collaboration with the engineering team to improve application performance.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
								<h3 class="text-lg font-medium">Software Engineering Intern, Cybersecurity · Communications Authority of Kenya</h3>
								<p class="text-sm text-muted">Jan 2023 – Apr 2023</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Nairobi, Kenya</p>
							<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 leading-7 text-muted">
								<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.7em] before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent">Researched cybersecurity threats and incidents in Kenya and produced reports with recommended mitigation strategies.</li>
								<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.7em] before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent">Conducted domain mapping, port scanning, and vulnerability assessments using open-source and proprietary security tools.</li>
								<li class="relative pl-5 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.7em] before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent">Selected as the sole intern to participate in a focus group contributing to the organisation’s 2023–2028 Strategic Plan.</li>
							</ul>
						</article>
						<article>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
								<h3 class="text-lg font-medium">Software Developer · Shades of Ruth</h3>
								<p class="text-sm text-muted">May 2022 – Sep 2022</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Nairobi, Kenya</p>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Developed and enhanced a responsive e-commerce application, supporting product, customer, and order management functionality, including an administrative interface.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section aria-labelledby="projects-title">
					<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Portfolio</p>
					<h2 id="projects-title" class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl">Selected projects</h2>
					<div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
						<article>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
								<h3 class="text-lg font-medium"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/projects/microvision">MicroVision</a> · Software Engineering &amp; Research Project</h3>
								<p class="text-sm text-muted">2025 – 2026</p>
							</div>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Developed a data-driven system for analysing large volumes of unstructured application logs to identify relationships between microservices, combining structured extraction, semantic analysis, information retrieval, and AI-based reasoning.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-medium"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/projects/shades-of-ruth">Shades of Ruth</a> · E-commerce application</h3>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Built and enhanced a responsive storefront with product, customer, order, and administration workflows.</p>
						</article>
						<article>
							<h3 class="text-lg font-medium"><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/projects/innobid">InnoBid</a> · Procurement-transparency concept</h3>
							<p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">Contributed to the prototype and anomaly-detection concept for identifying procurement bids that deviate from expected pricing patterns.</p>
						</article>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section aria-labelledby="achievements-title">
					<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Beyond the role</p>
					<h2 id="achievements-title" class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl">Programs and achievements</h2>
					<ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 leading-7 text-muted">
						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Dean’s List Award · Strathmore University</strong> — Awarded for excellent academic performance all four years.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Brno International Summer School in Information Technology</strong> — Completed an international summer school focused on Machine Learning.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Hackcorruption Hackathon · Accountability Lab</strong> — Won the competition with a digital solution for government procurement transparency and received a $10,000 development award.</li>
						<li><strong class="text-foreground">Microsoft Africa Development Center Software Engineering Mentorship Program</strong> — Collaborated in a five-person team on a sustainable agriculture solution for Kenyan farmers; placed second.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>
			</div>

			<aside class="resume-details h-fit rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
				<section aria-labelledby="education-title">
					<h2 id="education-title" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Education</h2>
					<h3 class="mt-4 font-medium">Bachelor of Science in Informatics and Computer Science</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Strathmore University<br />2020 – 2026<br />First Class Honours</p>
				</section>
				<section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="skills-title">
					<h2 id="skills-title" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Technical proficiencies</h2>
					<dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm">
						<div><dt class="text-muted">Programming</dt><dd class="mt-1 leading-6">Python · JavaScript/TypeScript · SQL · C++ · PHP</dd></div>
						<div><dt class="text-muted">Engineering</dt><dd class="mt-1 leading-6">React · Next.js · Redux Toolkit · Node.js · Express.js · REST APIs</dd></div>
						<div><dt class="text-muted">Data</dt><dd class="mt-1 leading-6">MySQL · MongoDB · Firestore · Data Analysis · Power BI</dd></div>
						<div><dt class="text-muted">AI</dt><dd class="mt-1 leading-6">Machine Learning · NLP · Embeddings · RAG · Vector Databases</dd></div>
						<div><dt class="text-muted">Infrastructure</dt><dd class="mt-1 leading-6">Firebase · Docker · Vercel · Git · GitHub · Linux · DigitalOcean</dd></div>
					</dl>
				</section>
				<section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="languages-title">
					<h2 id="languages-title" class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Languages</h2>
					<p class="mt-4 text-sm">English · Swahili</p>
				</section>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
